<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41393" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτόν-ιον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>peg</i> or <i>key</i> by
			which the strings of an instrument are tuned, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ψαλτηρίου</span> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήριον</span> cod.) prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				10.456d
			</span></i> : metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ συντροφία ὥσπερ ἐ. ἐστι τῆς
					εὐνοίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.3d
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>pitch-pipe</i> for giving the note to a choir, <i>Et.Gud.d.</i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπότομον.</span>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> any <i>peg</i> shaped 
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ.</span>
			 I. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				49.4.26
			</span></i>, al.; <i>handle</i> of a tap, <i>turn-cock,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Aut.</u>
				13.5
			</span></i>, Varro<i><span class="en">
				<u>RR</u>
				3.5.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vitr.
				9.8.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ulp.
			</span></i> ap. Dig.<i><span class="en">
				19.1.17.8
			</span></i> ; <i>handle</i> of a syringe, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Spir.</u>
				2.18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>valve</i> or <i>stop</i> in an organ-pipe, <i><span class="en">
				Vitr.
				10.8.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> pl.,
				<i>sockets</i> in which a roller was set, <i><span class="en">
				Bito
				49.10
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
